        "kind": "source_text",
        "slot_id": null,
        "source_id": "pre_text:14",
        "text": "the purchase price was financed with the net proceeds from the company 2019s december 2007 senior notes ( as defined in note 11 ) and revolver borrowings under the company 2019s june 2006 credit agreement , as amended in february 2007 and november 2007 ( as defined in note 11 ) .",
