        "text": "in june 2008 , the company sold certain businesses consisting of several of the california wineries and wine brands acquired in the bwe acquisition , as well as certain wineries and wine brands from the states of washington and idaho ( collectively , the 201cpacific northwest business 201d ) ( see note 7 ) .",
